# Cash Claw — pick one lane (do not mix in one Herdr pane)

**Studex forward strategy:** [CASHCLAW_STRATEGY.md](../../docs/CASHCLAW_STRATEGY.md) · factory **ZTE-009**.

Mission Control **CASHCLAW** = ROM / pricing / raise prep in this repo (`PLAN.md`, `mission-control/index.html`).  
**GitHub CashClaw** projects = agent monetization (OpenClaw skills or Moltlaunch marketplace).  
Keep this note as the decision + setup checklist only.

## 0 — Which CashClaw did you mean?

- [ ] **Studex CASHCLAW (finance lane)** — update `INVESTMENT.md` / ROM; Hermes or `claude` pane; no npm install
- [ ] **ertugrulakben/cashclaw** — OpenClaw skill pack, Stripe, HYRVE, Guard cost cap → `npx cashclaw init` on a host with OpenClaw
- [ ] **moltlaunch/cashclaw** — standalone agent + dashboard :3777, Moltlaunch tasks → `npm i -g cashclaw-agent moltlaunch`
- [ ] **derprofi1313/cash-claw** — OpenClaw fork + AEL + Stripe → clone and build

## 1 — Studex financial lane (repo only)

- [ ] Read `PLAN.md` blocker: INVESTMENT.md vs actual company model
- [ ] Open Mission Control → CASHCLAW row (ROM matrices, weekly roll-up)
- [ ] Draft ROM / pricing assumptions in vault (not in git until reviewed)
- [ ] Weekly: export summary to Drive archive stub via `scripts/agent-work-archive.sh` (sanitized)

## 2 — If using OpenClaw CashClaw skills (ertugrulakben)

- [ ] OpenClaw runtime installed on **one** trusted machine (not phone)
- [ ] `npx cashclaw init` — workspace `~/.cashclaw/`; Stripe optional at first
- [ ] Enable **Guard**: per-call and daily USD caps documented in vault (no API keys in notes)
- [ ] Herdr workspace `cashclaw` → pane runs vendor CLI only; checklists stay in Obsidian

## 3 — Mesh boundaries (Studex)

- [ ] CashClaw marketplace agents are **not** Paperclip Hermes Lead — register separately or keep offline
- [ ] Paperclip `:3100` remains company control plane (`docs/AGENT_COMPANY_SETUP.md`)
- [ ] Phone Hermes: chat + `task_bridge` only (`docs/HERMES_PHONE.md`)

